+/**
+ * Web Components for The Daily Grind Homepage
+ *
+ * Implements reusable, accessible Custom Elements with Shadow DOM encapsulation,
+ * Constructable Stylesheets (`adoptedStyleSheets`), and `ElementInternals` for
+ * custom states and default ARIA semantics.
+ */
